## Title: DreadVision
## APIVersion: 101049 101050
## Version: 0.6.2
## AddOnVersion: 602
## Author: Dreadazar
## Description: PvP threat readout for you and whoever you're looking at. Your own stun, off balance, roll dodges and break free are read straight from the game, exact. Your target's crowd control is read the same way, and their stamina and magicka are shown as a self-correcting percentage estimate, clearly marked as a guess. Everything exact stays exact; everything estimated is labelled as an estimate.
## SavedVariables: DreadVisionVars

DreadVision.lua
